    "A transition that blurs footage while bumping up the exposure to create a dynamic blend.",
    "If you need a flash of inspiration in applying Exposure Blur to transition between your clips, our one-click presets have you covered. Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste! Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create an Exposure Blur look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
